{
  "slug": "sdd",
  "name": "Sdd",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Story Driven Development workflow for Claude Code. Keeps your documentation and code in sync via status tracking and git-diff-based prompts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **6 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `sdd` (Story Driven Development workflow), `sdd-remote` (Remote sync workflow for Story Driven Development)\n- **Commands** (6): `sdd-bugs` (Show open bugs in the SDD project and offer to fix them), `sdd-crs` (Show pending Change Requests in the SDD project and offer to apply them), `sdd-pull` (Pull the latest specs from the SDD Flow remote), `sdd-push` (Push local SDD updates to the SDD Flow remote), `sdd-status` (Show SDD project status — all doc files and their sync state), `sdd-sync` (Run the SDD sync loop — bugs, CRs, then implement pending docs)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sdd@claude-community` from `applica-software-guru/sdd` (`packages/claude-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
